"│ Presets dialog             │   Ctrl+Alt+S │                            │                                           │\n"
"│ Use Preset #1(..#5)        │  Ctrl+1(..5) │                            │ Others from menu/dialog                   │\n"
"│ Use Layout #1(..#5)        │   Alt+1(..5) │                            │ Others from menu                          │\n"
