#:
#: /home/eltonff/Downloads/2-EXTRAS/CudaText_Plugins/cuda_find_in_files/cd_fi_in_fi.py:884
msgid ""
"\n"
"• \".*\" - Option \"Regular Expression\". \n"
"It allows to use in field \"Find what\" special symbols:\n"
"    .   any character\n"
"    \\d  digit character (0..9)\n"
"    \\w  word-like character (digits, letters, \"_\")\n"
"In field \"Replace with\":\n"
"    \\1  to insert first found group,\n"
"    \\2  to insert second found group, ... \n"
"See full documentation on page\n"
"    docs.python.org/3/library/re.html\n"
" \n"
"• \"w\" - {word}\n"
" \n"
"—————————————————————————————————————————————— \n"
" \n"
"• Values in fields \"{incl}\" and \"{excl}\" can contain\n"
"    ?       for any single char,\n"
"    *       for any substring (may be empty),\n"
"    [seq]   any character in seq,\n"
"    [!seq]  any character not in seq. \n"
"Note: \n"
"    *       matches all names, \n"
"    *.*     doesn't match all.\n"
" \n"
"• Values in fields \"{incl}\" and \"{excl}\" can filter subfolder names \n"
"if they start with \"/\".\n"
"Example.\n"
"    {incl:12}: /a*  *.txt\n"
"    {excl:12}: /ab*\n"
"    {fold:12}: c:/root\n"
"    Depth       : All\n"
"    Search will consider all *.txt files in folder c:/root\n"
"    and in all subfolders a* except ab*.\n"
" \n"
"• Set special value \"{tags}\" (in short <t> or <Tabs>) for field \"{fold}\" to search in opened documents.\n"
"Fields \"{incl}\" and \"{excl}\" will be used to filter tab titles, in this case.\n"
"To search in all tabs, use mask \"*\" in field \"{incl}\".\n"
"See also: menu items under button \"=\", \"Scope\".\n"
" \n"
"• Set special value \"{proj}\" (in short <p>) for field \"{fold}\" to search in project files.\n"
"See also: menu items under button \"=\", \"Scope\".\n"
" \n"
"—————————————————————————————————————————————— \n"
" \n"
"• \"Age\" (advanced search options).\n"
"    {olde}\n"
" \n"
"• \"First\" (advanced search options).\n"
"    {frst}\n"
" \n"
"—————————————————————————————————————————————— \n"
" \n"
"• Long-term searches can be interrupted by ESC.\n"
"Search has three stages: \n"
"    picking files, \n"
"    finding fragments, \n"
"    reporting.\n"
"ESC stops any stage. \n"
"When picking and finding, ESC stops only this stage, so next stage begins.\n"
" \n"
"—————————————————————————————————————————————— \n"
" \n"
"• Use right click or Context keyboard button \n"
"to see context menu over these elements\n"
"    \"Find\", \"Replace\", \"Current\", \"Browse\", Depth combobox\n"
" \n"
"—————————————————————————————————————————————— \n"
"You are welcome to plugin forum. See bottom link.\n"
msgstr "\n• \".*\" - Opção \"Expressão Regular\". \nPermite usar no campo \"Localizar\" símbolos especiais:\n .   qualquer caractere\n \\d caractere de dígito (0..9)\n \\w caractere semelhante a uma palavra (dígitos, letras, \"_\")\nNo campo \"Substituir por\":\n \\1 para inserir o primeiro grupo encontrado,\n \\2 para inserir o segundo grupo encontrado, ... \nVeja a documentação completa em page\n docs.python.org/3/library/re.html\n \n• \"w\" - {word}\n \n—————————————— \n \n• Os valores nos campos \"{incl}\" e \"{excl}\" podem conter\n ?       para qualquer caractere único,\n * para qualquer substring (pode estar vazio),\n [seq] qualquer caractere em seq,\n [!seq] qualquer caractere que não esteja em seq. \nNota: \n * corresponde a todos os nomes, \n *.* não corresponde a todos.\n \n• Os valores nos campos \"{incl}\" e \"{excl}\" podem filtrar nomes de subpastas \nse começarem com \"/\".\nExemplo.\n {incl:12}: /a* *.txt\n {excl:12}: /ab*\n {fold:12}: c:/root\n Profundidade: All\n A pesquisa considerará todos os arquivos *.txt na pasta c:/root\n e em todas as subpastas a* exceto ab*.\n \n• Defina o valor especial \"{tags}\" (abreviadamente <t> ou <Tabs>) para o campo \"{fold}\" para pesquisar em aberto documentos.\nOs campos \"{incl}\" e \"{excl}\" serão usados para filtrar os títulos das abas, neste caso.\nPara pesquisar em todas as abas, use a máscara \"*\" no campo \"{incl}\".\nVeja também: itens de menu sob o botão \"=\", \"Escopo\".\n \n• Defina o valor especial \"{proj}\" (abreviadamente <p>) para o campo \"{fold}\" to search in project files.\nSee also: menu items under button \"=\", \"Scope\".\n \n—————————————————————————————————————————————— \n \n• \"Age\" (advanced search options).\n {olde}\n \n• \"Primeiro\" (opções de pesquisa avançada).\n {frst}\n \n——————————————————————— \n \n• Pesquisas de longo prazo podem ser interrompidas por ESC.\nSearch tem três estágios: \n selecionando arquivos, \n encontrando fragmentos, \n reportando.\nESC interrompe qualquer estágio. \nWhen picking and finding, ESC stops only this stage, so next stage begins.\n \n—————————————————————————————————————————————— \n \n• Use right click or Context keyboard button \nto see context menu over these elements\n    \"Find\", \"Replace\", \"Current\", \"Browse\", Depth combobox\n \n—————————————————————————————————————————————— \nYou are welcome to plugin forum. Veja o link inferior.\n"

